\]
Calculating the product, we get:
\[
\begin{pmatrix}
\sqrt{13} \cdot (-2) + \left(-\frac{3}{\sqrt{13}}\right) \cdot 3 \\
\frac{3}{\sqrt{13}} \cdot (-2) + \sqrt{13} \cdot 3
\end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix}
