\frac{-6 + 39}{\sqrt{13}}
\end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix}
-\sqrt{13} - \frac{9}{\sqrt{13}} \\
\frac{33}{\sqrt{13}}
\end{pmatrix}
\]
Simplifying, we get:
\[
\begin{pmatrix}
-\sqrt{13} - \frac{9}{\sqrt{13}} \\
\frac{33}{\sqrt{13}}
\end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix}
-5 - 3 \\
3\sqrt{13} - 3
